{"name": "Ghost Hand", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Astaria: a world of surreal, dreamlike beauty, realized by a one-of-a-kind blend of 2D &amp; 3D and an oil-painting artstyle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.poster.avif?t=1779035311\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.webm?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.mp4?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Iria, the young, inexperienced moon witch, must grow in the power of her Ghost Hands to have any hope of throwing down with the massive, terrifyingly beautiful \u2014 and beautifully terrifying \u2014 bosses that inhabit Astaria </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.poster.avif?t=1779035311\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.webm?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.mp4?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Throughout her journey, Iria will make many allies, and many enemies, but none so magnificent as Isharge, on whose wings she will travel the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.poster.avif?t=1779035311\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.webm?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.mp4?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Through new outfits with special abilities, Iria will acquire new powers, new friends to help fight, and most importantly, a current and refined sense of fashion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.poster.avif?t=1779035311\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.webm?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.mp4?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In her travels, Iria will experience a living planet: changing weather that with it brings new enemies and changes to the environment, as well as moving parallax backgrounds that proclaim the vastness of the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4d24f8f0a2df7574fff05d617c849534.poster.avif?t=1779035311\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4d24f8f0a2df7574fff05d617c849534.webm?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4d24f8f0a2df7574fff05d617c849534.mp4?t=1779035311\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> And all the while, melodies will play in Iria\u2019s mind: melodies of life as the rain falls and becomes the river, and melodies of death as nightmare beetles hunt her throughout their den</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Descend from the Moon and become Iria, the horned Lunar Witch who weaponizes her very soul to manifest the Ghost Hands, with whose power she must liberate Astaria, a painstakingly rendered Metroidvania world of living, breathing beauty.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/3b5b9cfa9a5963b6becf82eee32637a72f832c2c/header.jpg?t=1779035311", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Hack and Slash", "Platformer", "Action-Adventure", "Character Customization", "Female Protagonist", "2.5D"], "developers": "Galo, Vermanubis", "publishers": "Galo, Vermanubis", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2563880", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "24 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/4MA_6SwMPdo", "first_seen": 1740355200.0, "review_rank": 1786}